The quotation describes a tiered/layered system of educational support for children with varying needs — universal provision, targeted Individual Support Plans, and specialist provision. The specific mechanism is a differentiated service delivery structure within schools for children with special educational needs.

This is squarely about education policy and the organization of educational provision (I2 — Education and Research Institutions). There is no substantively distinct secondary economic dimension warranting an additional code.

